1czp|v|To observe; to see to mark; to take note of; to heed; to pay attention to. ; To show that one has observed; to take public note of; remark upon; to make comments on; to refer to; as, to notice a book. ; To treat with attention and civility; as, to notice strangers.	d:2cj,25,5~2cj,25,5
